/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 62 0 R
/T (Answer: Convolutional layers detect features such as edges and shapes. Pooling layers reduce the size of feature maps and retain important information. Fully connected layers use the extracted features to perform the final classification.)
/E (Answer: Convolutional layers detect features such as edges and shapes. Pooling layers reduce the size of feature maps and retain important information. Fully connected layers use the extracted features to perform the final classification.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
