/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 62 0 R
/T (Answer: Image normalization scales pixel values to a smaller range such as 0 to 1. It helps the neural network train faster and makes the optimization process more stable.)
/E (Answer: Image normalization scales pixel values to a smaller range such as 0 to 1. It helps the neural network train faster and makes the optimization process more stable.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
